# Short name

Graph node: <node, if any>. Spec: [page](/page).

## Resume

Owner session; resume it from the repo root on its machine:

```bash
copilot --resume <session-id>
```

Machine: `<host>`. Branch: `<branch>`.

## Ask

Why this exists and the outcome wanted, in two or three sentences.

## Steps

- [ ] First concrete step.
- [ ] Next step. Say how it is checked.
- [ ] Commit on `<branch>`; short report.

## Check

The one observable result that says this is done.

## Stop rule

When to stop and report instead of continuing (optional).

## Notes

Builder notes, results and decisions, added as work proceeds.
